nd recharge. Examples include taking a bath, reading a book, or engaging in any activity that brings you peace and relaxation.\n\nRemember, it's essential to experiment with different strategies and find what works best for you. Managing stress is a process that requires trial and error. Track your progress and make adjustments as needed. By taking a comprehensive and personalized approach, you can learn to manage stress effectively.": 2.515625,
